% backend: none
% expect-output: a--b--
% expect-output: abc
% expect-output: abcdef
% Scenario: SubFileDecode by count. With a count and a string the data
% runs through the count-th occurrence of the string, inclusive; with a
% count and an empty string exactly that many bytes pass; with neither,
% everything does. The positional and dictionary forms agree.
% Expect: a--b--, abc, abcdef.
(a--b--c--) 2 (--) /SubFileDecode filter 100 string readstring pop =
(abcdef) << /EODCount 3 /EODString () >> /SubFileDecode filter
100 string readstring pop =
(abcdef) 0 () /SubFileDecode filter 100 string readstring pop =
